#~ msgid "关于我们"
#~ msgstr "About Us"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keydion 是一个专为高中设计的学术资产平台。我们聚焦于学生的科研成果，包括 IA、EE、TOK "
#~ "等项目。通过本平台，学生的研究成果将不再被忽视，而是被系统性地保存于 Keydion\n"
#~ "            数据库中，供师生查阅与参考。同时，教师也可以更全面地了解本校科研项目的内容与整体质量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Keydion is an academic asset platform"
#~ " specifically designed for high schools."
#~ " We focus on students' research "
#~ "output, including IA, EE, TOK, and "
#~ "other projects. Through this platform, "
#~ "students' research achievements will no "
#~ "longer be overlooked but systematically "
#~ "preserved in the Keydion database for"
#~ " reference by teachers and students. "
#~ "Moreover, teachers can gain a more "
#~ "comprehensive understanding of the content "
#~ "and overall quality of research projects"
#~ " at their school."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keydion\n"
#~ "            "
#~ "同样致力于维护学术诚信，避免撞题以及学术不端误判。我们希望为每一所学校留存这些珍贵的学术成果，让优秀的学生研究经验得以传承，使学术探索不再只是一次性的作业，而成为可以持续积累与发展的知识资产。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Keydion is also dedicated to maintaining"
#~ " academic integrity by preventing topic "
#~ "overlap and avoiding false accusations "
#~ "of academic misconduct. We hope to "
#~ "preserve these precious academic achievements"
#~ " for every school, allowing outstanding "
#~ "student research experiences to be "
#~ "passed down, so that academic "
#~ "exploration is no longer just a "
#~ "one-off assignment but a knowledge "
#~ "asset that can be continuously "
#~ "accumulated and developed."

